iscipline; common refinement Spec(B \u2297 B') with prodInl/prodInr witnesses and directedness; trivial cover refined by everything; base change A' \u2297 B along any A \u2192 A' with baseChangeInclude; field cofinality PROVED (every cover of Spec K is refined by a single finite separable field extension, via mathlib's \u00e9tale-over-field product dictionary + single-factor projection) with ofField packaging. Pure algebra, no scheme imports, mathlib-PR candidate; registered in the root; kernel build green, axiom audits standard three"}, {"sha": "179d5d35175078aa3e3ff92e20f06d3f3383cbe3", "subject": "Divisor classes from local equations (Wave-3 lane L2, file 4, delegated build): Scheme.LocalEquations packages one regular section per member of a pointed cover with unit overlap-ratios \u2014 the trivialization data of O(D) with transition units g i j = f_i/f_j; stalk-level regularity is the primitive (restrictions to sub-opens stay nonzerodivisors via sheaf section_ext), making the ratio unit UNIQUE, whence the cocycle identity on triple overlaps and the \u010cech Picard class picClass. Invariance ledger: refinement (picClass_restrict), unitwise rescaling via an explicit v\u207b\u00b9-coboundary (picClass_rescale), and multiplicativity on the common refinement (picClass_mul, anchored on mk_mul_mk_inf). Pullback compatibility deferred (line cap). Plus the algebra-map face of the relative Picard functor (Picard/RelPicAlgebra.lean): overSpecMap = Spec of a k-algebra map as an Over(Spec k) morphism, strictly functorial, and relPicAlgMap with functor laws \u2014 the interface the \u00e9tale plus construction consumes. Both files kernel-green, axiom audits standard three; registered in the root"}], "files": [{"path": "MainProjects/Algebraic-Jacobian-Challenge-Rebuild/AlgebraicJacobian.lean", "category": "lean", "add": 3, "del": 0, "loc_after": 43, "loc_before": 40, "loc_code_after": 34, "loc_code_before": 31, "sorry_after": 0, "sorry_before": 0, "sorry_delta": 0, "decl_afte